  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/69a79ada89d9d957cccd1b57db6705e5788236aa_0.webp\" alt=\"The Vintage logo with the artwork as the background.\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">一個以經典材質、概念藝術和已移除的特性為靈感/基礎，重新設計遊戲外觀的資源包。<br><br>建議搭配<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fhome\" rel=\"nofollow\">Optifine</a></span>或 Fabric 版的<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-texture-features-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">ETF</a></span>以及<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-model-features/files/5304272\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">EMF</span></a>模組一起使用！</p>\n<p>更多截圖</p>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5b30c0b72b07ab89cd8c3a36085585fd00edbb73_0.webp\" alt=\"Forest\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a03323322637b31b1dcc2c54030c1a6e621a8868_0.webp\" alt=\"Birch Forest\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/86de980d7c39511cd9db0032faa8aa59bbea8429_0.webp\" alt=\"Taiga\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ae99af7aafdae8817ec45a26c7802b1724360331_0.webp\" alt=\"Savanna\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2526785cddc5c0f4b1d560f4c2a3de84b21e1afa.png\" alt=\"Jungle\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ebb66286b0aadad483badc8a15ed354347bcb644_0.webp\" alt=\"Mansion\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/365761f0d27b9e6b42a4010b82727130debaaed7_0.webp\" alt=\"Nether\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7c3efd76c6ce99652f94ebca8572cbd15ad43f36_0.webp\" alt=\"End City\"></p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/dacc80f82c8fa3f84ab58db0508a110c8b3d3ba6.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>使用條款</strong></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><hr></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>如果您希望在您的產品中使用 Vintage 的某些功能，請先聯繫我們獲取許可並給予署名。<br><br>您被允許：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>在影片、伺服器等在內進行推廣或包含此資源包，並連結回原頁面。</li>\n<li>在獲得許可後使用或修改一或多個材質。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>您被禁止：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>未經官方授權重新發布此資源包。</li>\n<li>將任何功能設置為付費牆內容。</li>\n<li>聲稱這是您自己的作品。</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fRedPierre01\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitter/X 上的 Vintage</a></span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">2022 - 2026 RedPierre, Team UNNAMED.</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">未使用的 Minecraft 音樂來自 C418 的 Alpha 和 Beta 專輯。</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>",
